# 🏢 Lift Control System

A professional-grade Flutter mobile application for wireless Bluetooth-based lift (elevator) control and monitoring.

## Quick Start

```bash
# Install dependencies
flutter pub get

# Run the app
flutter run

# Build for release
flutter build apk --release  # Android
flutter build ios --release   # iOS
```

## Features

✅ **Bluetooth Control** — Real-time lift control via Bluetooth Classic  
✅ **Safety Alerts** — Child detection and overload protection  
✅ **Multi-Platform** — iOS, Android, macOS, Linux, Windows  
✅ **Clean Architecture** — BLoC pattern with service layer abstraction  
✅ **Responsive UI** — Material Design 3 with dark theme

## Tech Stack

- **Flutter 3.12+** — Cross-platform UI framework
- **Dart 3.12+** — Type-safe programming language
- **flutter_bloc 9.1.1** — State management
- **flutter_bluetooth_classic_serial** — Bluetooth communication
- **permission_handler** — Permission management

## Architecture

```
UI Layer (HomeScreen + BlocConsumer)
    ↓
Business Logic (BluetoothCubit)
    ↓
Service Layer (BluetoothService)
    ↓
Native Bluetooth (flutter_bluetooth_classic_serial)
```

